#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "List or filter backends {#list-or-filter-backends}"
msgstr "Senaraikan atau tapis backend {#list-or-filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "List backends available to you {#list-backends-available-to-you}"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan backend yang tersedia untuk anda {#list-backends-available-to-"
"you}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use either Qiskit or IBM Quantum Platform to view a list of backends"
" available to you, or to search for a particular backend.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan sama ada Qiskit atau IBM Quantum Platform untuk "
"melihat senarai backend yang tersedia untuk anda, atau untuk mencari backend"
" tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"QPU names\">\n"
"QPUs hosted on IBM Cloud&reg; have names that begin with `ibm_*`. All QPUs are given a city name - for example, `ibm_kingston`. This name does not indicate where the actual QPU is hosted.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nama QPU\">\n"
"QPU yang dihoskan di IBM Cloud&reg; mempunyai nama yang bermula dengan `ibm_*`. Semua QPU diberi nama bandar - contohnya, `ibm_kingston`. Nama ini tidak menunjukkan di mana QPU sebenarnya dihoskan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) method, as shown in the next code block. This method returns a list of [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"Lihat backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan kaedah [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends), seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam blok kod seterusnya. Kaedah ini mengembalikan senarai instans [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        To run the following code, be sure you have already authenticated to"
" the service. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for "
"more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"        Untuk menjalankan kod berikut, pastikan anda telah pun mengesahkan "
"ke perkhidmatan. Lihat [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud anda](/guides/cloud-setup) "
"untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        To search for a specific backend, use the "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) method (note that this is "
"singular: *backend*), which takes the name of the backend as the input "
"parameter and returns an "
"[`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-"
"backend) instance representing that particular backend:\n"
msgstr ""
"        Untuk mencari backend tertentu, gunakan kaedah "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) (perhatikan bahawa ini adalah "
"tunggal: *backend*), yang mengambil nama backend sebagai parameter input dan"
" mengembalikan instans "
"[`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-"
"backend) yang mewakili backend tertentu itu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, navigate to the list of backends on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (note that your selected region might impact the QPUs listed). Click the filter icon and choose either \"All my instances\" or a specific instance name to see the available QPUs.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"Lihat backend di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Untuk melihat backend yang boleh anda akses, layari senarai backend di [halaman Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (perhatikan bahawa rantau yang anda pilih mungkin mempengaruhi QPU yang disenaraikan). Klik ikon tapisan dan pilih sama ada \"All my instances\" atau nama instans tertentu untuk melihat QPU yang tersedia.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   If you are logged in to a specific instance or region, or if you initialized the service with a specific instance or region by using `QiskitRuntimeService()`, only the backends available to you on that instance or region are returned.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Jika anda log masuk ke instans atau rantau tertentu, atau jika anda memulakan perkhidmatan dengan instans atau rantau tertentu menggunakan `QiskitRuntimeService()`, hanya backend yang tersedia untuk anda pada instans atau rantau itu yang dikembalikan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Filter backends {#filter-backends}"
msgstr "Tapis backend {#filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can filter the available backends by their [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) or [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). For more general filters, set the `filters` argument to a function that accepts a backend object and returns `True` if it meets your criteria. Refer to the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Tapis mengikut sifat dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Anda boleh menapis backend yang tersedia mengikut [konfigurasi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) atau [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status) mereka. Untuk tapisan yang lebih umum, tetapkan argumen `filters` kepada fungsi yang menerima objek backend dan mengembalikan `True` jika ia memenuhi kriteria anda. Rujuk [dokumentasi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        The following code returns only backends that fit these criteria and"
" are available to you _on your currently selected instance_:\n"
msgstr ""
"        Kod berikut hanya mengembalikan backend yang memenuhi kriteria ini "
"dan tersedia untuk anda _pada instans yang anda pilih sekarang_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Are real quantum devices (`simulator=False`)\n"
msgstr "Adalah peranti kuantum sebenar (`simulator=False`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Are currently operational (`operational=True`)\n"
msgstr "Sedang beroperasi (`operational=True`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Have at least a hundred qubits (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"
msgstr "Mempunyai sekurang-kurangnya seratus qubit (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        A similar method is "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), which takes the same filters"
" as `backends()` but returns the backend that matches the filters and has "
"the least number of jobs pending in the queue:\n"
msgstr ""
"        Kaedah serupa ialah "
"[`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), yang mengambil tapisan yang "
"sama dengan `backends()` tetapi mengembalikan backend yang sepadan dengan "
"tapisan dan mempunyai bilangan kerja paling sedikit yang menunggu dalam "
"baris gilir:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, view the table on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Click the filter icon to see filter options. You can filter by processor type and status. Note also that you can sort the table by any column by hovering over a column title, and then clicking the arrows that appear.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Tapis mengikut sifat di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Untuk melihat backend yang boleh anda akses, lihat jadual di [halaman Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Klik ikon tapisan untuk melihat pilihan tapisan. Anda boleh menapis mengikut jenis pemproses dan status. Perhatikan juga bahawa anda boleh menyusun jadual mengikut mana-mana lajur dengan menuding di atas tajuk lajur, dan kemudian mengklik anak panah yang muncul.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Static backend information {#static-backend-information}"
msgstr "Maklumat backend statik {#static-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some information about a backend does not change regularly, such as its "
"name, [version](#qpu-versioning), the number of qubits it has, its processor"
" type (the bird family name, which indicates the [topology](#coupling-map) "
"and approximate qubit count), and the types of features it supports. This "
"information is available as attributes of the `backend` object. For a full "
"list of attributes, see the [`IBMBackend` API "
"documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-"
"backend).  Find more information on versioning in the [QPU versioning](#qpu-"
"versioning) section below.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sesetengah maklumat tentang backend tidak berubah secara berkala, seperti "
"namanya, [versi](#qpu-versioning), bilangan qubit yang dimilikinya, jenis "
"pemprosesnya (nama keluarga burung, yang menunjukkan [topologi](#coupling-"
"map) dan anggaran bilangan qubit), dan jenis ciri yang disokongnya. Maklumat"
" ini tersedia sebagai atribut objek `backend`. Untuk senarai penuh atribut, "
"lihat [dokumentasi API "
"`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-"
"backend).  Cari maklumat lanjut tentang penomboran versi dalam bahagian "
"[Penomboran versi QPU](#qpu-versioning) di bawah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A backend's region (the location of the data center where your data and "
"experiments will be hosted and processed) is listed in its detailed "
"information card on the [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page on IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rantau backend (lokasi pusat data di mana data dan eksperimen anda akan "
"dihoskan dan diproses) disenaraikan dalam kad maklumat terperincinya di "
"halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) di IBM "
"Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"Lihat maklumat backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"Lihat maklumat backend di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of "
"all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information "
"card. Find backend information under the Details section of the card.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Layari halaman [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat jadual "
"semua QPU, kemudian klik nama mana-mana QPU untuk membuka kad maklumat "
"terperincinya. Cari maklumat backend di bawah bahagian Details kad "
"tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "QPU versioning {#qpu-versioning}"
msgstr "Penomboran versi QPU {#qpu-versioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each QPU has a version number in the form X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). A "
"circuit compiled for a given version number is guaranteed to run on that "
"QPU. If the revision number changes, the circuit will continue to run. If "
"the major or minor number changes, the circuit is not guaranteed to run, "
"although it may do so.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap QPU mempunyai nombor versi dalam format X.Y.Z (utama.kecil.semakan). "
"Litar yang dikompil untuk nombor versi tertentu dijamin akan berjalan pada "
"QPU tersebut. Jika nombor semakan berubah, litar akan terus berjalan. Jika "
"nombor utama atau kecil berubah, litar tidak dijamin akan berjalan, walaupun"
" mungkin boleh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The revision version number will increment for fixes that do not break the "
"existing compiled circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nombor versi semakan akan ditambah untuk pembetulan yang tidak memecahkan "
"litar yang dikompil sedia ada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code example earlier in [this section](#static-backend-information) "
"demonstrates how to find a backend's version. On IBM Quantum Platform, you "
"can view the version on a QPU's detailed information card (click the QPU's "
"name on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) "
"table to open the card).\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh kod sebelum ini dalam [bahagian ini](#static-backend-information) "
"menunjukkan cara mencari versi backend. Di IBM Quantum Platform, anda boleh "
"melihat versi pada kad maklumat terperinci QPU (klik nama QPU pada jadual "
"[Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk membuka "
"kad tersebut).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The conditions under which a version or revision number can change are "
"listed in the following table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Syarat-syarat di mana nombor versi atau semakan boleh berubah disenaraikan "
"dalam jadual berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Major version | Minor version | Revision version |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Sample changes| Warmup / cool-down cycles | QPU software updates |\n"
"|Major changes to the control electronics| Swapping out some electronics, if the replacement appreciably affects operation| Manual calibrations to improve fidelities |\n"
"|Moving the QPU to a new location, if significant behavior changes result| Dropping a gate for some duration of time due to calibration issues, and corrections cannot readily be done in software| Small electronics changes that don’t affect operation |\n"
"| |Changing the direction of a CNOT gate | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"| Versi utama | Versi kecil | Versi semakan |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Perubahan sampel| Kitaran pemanasan / penyejukan | Kemas kini perisian QPU |\n"
"|Perubahan besar pada elektronik kawalan| Menggantikan sebahagian elektronik, jika penggantian mempengaruhi operasi dengan ketara| Penentukuran manual untuk meningkatkan kesetiaan |\n"
"|Memindahkan QPU ke lokasi baharu, jika perubahan tingkah laku yang ketara berlaku| Menangguhkan get untuk tempoh masa tertentu disebabkan isu penentukuran, dan pembetulan tidak dapat dilakukan dengan mudah dalam perisian| Perubahan kecil pada elektronik yang tidak menjejaskan operasi |\n"
"| |Menukar arah get CNOT | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Supported instructions {#supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan yang disokong {#supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each [processor family](/guides/processor-types) natively supports a limited"
" set of instructions. This set includes single- and two-qubit gates, as well"
" as non-unitary operations such as measure and reset. Every gate in the "
"circuit must be translated (by the transpiler) to the elements of a QPU's "
"supported instruction set before it can run on the QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap [keluarga pemproses](/guides/processor-types) secara natif menyokong "
"set arahan yang terhad. Set ini termasuk get satu- dan dua-qubit, serta "
"operasi bukan unitari seperti measure dan reset. Setiap get dalam litar "
"mesti diterjemahkan (oleh transpiler) kepada elemen set arahan yang disokong"
" QPU sebelum ia boleh berjalan pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can view the supported instruction sets for a QPU with Qiskit. The IBM "
"Quantum Platform Compute resources page lists only the supported unitary "
"gates (basis gates) for a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh melihat set arahan yang disokong untuk QPU dengan Qiskit. Halaman"
" Compute resources IBM Quantum Platform hanya menyenaraikan get unitari yang"
" disokong (get asas) untuk QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Cari arahan yang disokong dengan Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Cari get asas di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. The basis gates for that QPU are listed in the Details section.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Layari halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat jadual semua QPU, kemudian klik nama mana-mana QPU untuk membuka kad maklumat terperincinya. Get asas untuk QPU tersebut disenaraikan dalam bahagian Details.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Table of supported instructions {#table-of-supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Jadual arahan yang disokong {#table-of-supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operation category |  Name |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
"| Non-unitary instructions | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kategori operasi |  Nama |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Get satu-qubit | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Get dua-qubit | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Get pecahan | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (satu-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (dua-qubit) |\n"
"| Arahan bukan unitari | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Aliran kawalan | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (suap balik klasik) |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic backend information {#dynamic-backend-information}"
msgstr "Maklumat backend dinamik {#dynamic-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Backends also have properties that change whenever the backend is "
"calibrated, such as qubit lifetime and operation error rates. Backend "
"properties update after the calibration sequence completes. These properties"
" can be used when optimizing quantum circuits or to construct noise models "
"for a classical simulator. See the [Calibration jobs](/guides/calibration-"
"jobs) guide for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Backend juga mempunyai sifat yang berubah setiap kali backend ditentukur, "
"seperti hayat qubit dan kadar ralat operasi. Sifat backend dikemas kini "
"selepas jujukan penentukuran selesai. Sifat-sifat ini boleh digunakan semasa"
" mengoptimumkan litar kuantum atau untuk membina model hingar bagi simulator"
" klasik. Lihat panduan [Kerja penentukuran](/guides/calibration-jobs) untuk "
"maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On IBM Quantum Platform, you can download calibration data as a CSV file. "
"Click a QPU on the [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view its "
"detailed information card, then click the download icon in the upper right "
"corner of the Calibration data section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di IBM Quantum Platform, anda boleh memuat turun data penentukuran sebagai "
"fail CSV. Klik QPU pada halaman [Compute "
"resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat kad "
"maklumat terperincinya, kemudian klik ikon muat turun di penjuru kanan atas "
"bahagian Calibration data.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Retrieve historical data\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Dapatkan semula data sejarah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can retrieve historical backend properties data in Qiskit with the "
"following code:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mendapatkan semula data sifat backend sejarah dalam Qiskit dengan"
" kod berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qubit properties {#qubit-properties}"
msgstr "Sifat qubit {#qubit-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Jump to the list of qubit properties](#view-qubit-properties)\n"
msgstr "[Lompat ke senarai sifat qubit](#view-qubit-properties)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`backend.properties().qubit_property()` returns information about the "
"qubits' physical attributes. It contains a dictionary of various properties "
"of the qubit, each paired with its value and the timestamp of the last "
"calibration.\n"
msgstr ""
"`backend.properties().qubit_property()` mengembalikan maklumat tentang "
"atribut fizikal qubit. Ia mengandungi kamus pelbagai sifat qubit, setiap "
"satu dipasangkan dengan nilainya dan cap masa penentukuran terakhir.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code examples demonstrate how to list all properties, or "
"retrieve specific properties, of a particular qubit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh kod berikut menunjukkan cara menyenaraikan semua sifat, atau "
"mendapatkan sifat tertentu, bagi qubit tertentu.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View qubit properties {#view-qubit-properties}"
msgstr "Lihat sifat qubit {#view-qubit-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Relaxation time)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Masa relaksasi)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The $T_1$ time represents the average duration a qubit remains in its "
"excited state $|1\\rangle$ before decaying to its ground state $|0\\rangle$ "
"due to energy relaxation. This parameter is used to characterize the qubit's"
" energy relaxation behavior, and is expressed in units of seconds (s).\n"
msgstr ""
"Masa $T_1$ mewakili tempoh purata qubit kekal dalam keadaan terujanya "
"$|1\\rangle$ sebelum mereput ke keadaan dasarnya $|0\\rangle$ akibat "
"relaksasi tenaga. Parameter ini digunakan untuk mencirikan tingkah laku "
"relaksasi tenaga qubit, dan dinyatakan dalam unit saat (s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t1(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_1$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t1(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Calibration data, menu lungsur qubit; cari nilai *median $T_1$* dalam bahagian Details</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"t2\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T2` (Dephasing time)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"t2\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T2` (Masa defasaan)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The $T_2$ time denotes the timescale over which a qubit maintains phase "
"coherence of a superposition between the $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ "
"states. It accounts for both energy relaxation and pure dephasing processes,"
" providing insight into the qubit's coherence properties. $T_2$ is reported "
"from a Hahn echo sequence.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masa $T_2$ menandakan skala masa di mana qubit mengekalkan koheren fasa "
"superposisi antara keadaan $|0\\rangle$ dan $|1\\rangle$. Ia mengambil kira "
"relaksasi tenaga dan proses defasaan tulen, memberikan gambaran tentang "
"sifat koheren qubit. $T_2$ dilaporkan daripada jujukan Hahn echo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t2(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu; find the *$T_2$ median* value in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().t2(<qubit>)`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Calibration data, menu lungsur qubit; cari nilai *median $T_2$* dalam bahagian Details</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction properties {#instruction-properties}"
msgstr "Sifat arahan {#instruction-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Jump to the list of instruction properties](#view-instruction-properties)\n"
msgstr "[Lompat ke senarai sifat arahan](#view-instruction-properties)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend.target` attribute is a "
"[`qiskit.transpiler.Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" object: an object that contains all the information needed to transpile a "
"circuit for that backend. This includes instruction errors and durations. "
"For example, the following cell gets the properties for a [`cz` "
"gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate)"
" acting between qubits 1 and 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Atribut `backend.target` ialah objek "
"[`qiskit.transpiler.Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):"
" objek yang mengandungi semua maklumat yang diperlukan untuk mentranspil "
"litar bagi backend tersebut. Ini termasuk ralat arahan dan tempoh. "
"Contohnya, sel berikut mendapatkan sifat untuk [`cz` "
"gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate)"
" yang bertindak antara qubit 1 dan 0.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following cell shows the properties for a measurement operation "
"(including the readout error) on qubit 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sel berikut menunjukkan sifat untuk operasi pengukuran (termasuk ralat "
"bacaan) pada qubit 0.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View instruction properties {#view-instruction-properties}"
msgstr "Lihat sifat arahan {#view-instruction-properties}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas0-prep1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas0-prep1\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas0-prep1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas0-prep1\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This parameter indicates the probability of measuring a qubit in the 0 state"
" when it was intended to be prepared in the $|1\\rangle$ state, denoted as "
"$P(0 | 1)$. It reflects errors in state preparation and measurement (SPAM), "
"particularly measurement errors in superconducting qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parameter ini menunjukkan kebarangkalian mengukur qubit dalam keadaan 0 "
"apabila ia dimaksudkan untuk disediakan dalam keadaan $|1\\rangle$, "
"dinyatakan sebagai $P(0 | 1)$. Ia mencerminkan ralat dalam persediaan "
"keadaan dan pengukuran (SPAM), terutamanya ralat pengukuran dalam qubit "
"superkonduktor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep1')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep1')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Calibration data, menu lungsur qubit</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas1-prep0\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas1-prep0\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"prob-meas1-prep0\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"prob-meas1-prep0\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Similarly, this parameter represents the probability of measuring a qubit in"
" the 1 state when it was intended to be prepared in the $|0\\rangle$ state, "
"denoted as $P(1 | 0)$. Like `prob_meas0_prep1`, it reflects SPAM errors, "
"with measurement errors being the predominant contributor in superconducting"
" qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Begitu juga, parameter ini mewakili kebarangkalian mengukur qubit dalam "
"keadaan 1 apabila ia dimaksudkan untuk disediakan dalam keadaan "
"$|0\\rangle$, dinyatakan sebagai $P(1 | 0)$. Seperti `prob_meas0_prep1`, ia "
"mencerminkan ralat SPAM, dengan ralat pengukuran menjadi penyumbang utama "
"dalam qubit superkonduktor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep0')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration data section, Qubit dropdown menu</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"2Q error (Heron and Nighthawk: CZ, Eagle: ECR)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.properties().qubit_property(<qubit>, 'prob_meas0_prep0')`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Calibration data, menu lungsur qubit</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ralat 2Q (Heron dan Nighthawk: CZ, Eagle: ECR)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The two-qubit error per edge from the same batch of measurements used to "
"calculate the [2Q median](#2q-error-median) error. **2Q error (best)** "
"refers to the lowest two-qubit error on any edge of the device, also from "
"this batch of measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ralat dua-qubit setiap tepi daripada kelompok pengukuran yang sama yang "
"digunakan untuk mengira ralat [median 2Q](#2q-error-median). **Ralat 2Q "
"(terbaik)** merujuk kepada ralat dua-qubit terendah pada mana-mana tepi "
"peranti, juga daripada kelompok pengukuran ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.target['<instruction>'][<qubit 1>, <qubit 2>]`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Calibration section: hover over the qubit connection in Map view, or find the value in Table view under the CZ error (Heron and Nighthawk) or ECR error (Eagle) column; find the value for *2Q error (best)* in the Details section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error-median\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Median 2Q error (Heron: CZ, Eagle: ECR)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>`backend.target['<instruction>'][<qubit 1>, <qubit 2>]`</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Calibration: tuding di atas sambungan qubit dalam paparan Map, atau cari nilai dalam paparan Table di bawah lajur CZ error (Heron dan Nighthawk) atau ECR error (Eagle); cari nilai untuk *2Q error (best)* dalam bahagian Details</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error-median\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Median ralat 2Q (Heron: CZ, Eagle: ECR)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Average gate "
"fidelity](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity)"
" of the two-qubit operation from randomized benchmarking. Measured in "
"\"isolation\": batches with a minimum separation of two qubits between "
"edges. This randomized benchmarking uses alternating layers of single-qubit "
"Cliffords and two-qubit gates, and thus the final 2Q error value includes "
"the error of the layer of single-qubit Cliffords.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Kesetiaan get "
"purata](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity)"
" operasi dua-qubit daripada penanda aras rawak. Diukur dalam "
"\"pengasingan\": kelompok dengan pemisahan minimum dua qubit antara tepi. "
"Penanda aras rawak ini menggunakan lapisan berselang-seli Clifford satu-"
"qubit dan get dua-qubit, oleh itu nilai ralat 2Q akhir termasuk ralat "
"lapisan Clifford satu-qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Calculate with Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>Follow the example in this [Qiskit Community GitHub notebook](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-device-benchmarking/blob/main/notebooks/device_rb_w_lf.ipynb)</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">View on IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Details section; also find per-edge data in the Calibration data section</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error-layered\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"2Q error (layered)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>\n"
"  <tbody>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Kira dengan Qiskit</th>\n"
"      <td>Ikuti contoh dalam [notebook GitHub Qiskit Community](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-device-benchmarking/blob/main/notebooks/device_rb_w_lf.ipynb) ini</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"      <th scope=\"row\">Lihat di IBM Quantum Platform</th>\n"
"      <td>Bahagian Details; juga cari data setiap tepi dalam bahagian Calibration data</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error-layered\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ralat 2Q (berlapis)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Average error per layered gate (EPLG) in a chain of 100 qubits. Average EPLG"
" measures the average gate error in a layered chain of $N$ qubits ($N$=100 "
"here). It is derived from a similar quantity known as the layer fidelity "
"(LF) where EPLG$_{100}$ = 4/5(1-LF$^{\\frac{1}{99}}$) and layer fidelity is "
"the process fidelity of the layered chain of $N$ qubits. For details, see "
"the paper [Benchmarking quantum processor performance at "
"scale](https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05933). Note that in the paper EPLG is "
"defined for process error, but for consistency with the individually "
"reported gate errors here it is quoted for average gate error, thus the "
"factor of 4/5.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ralat purata setiap get berlapis (EPLG) dalam rantai 100 qubit. EPLG purata "
"mengukur ralat get purata dalam rantai berlapis $N$ qubit ($N$=100 di sini)."
" Ia diterbitkan daripada kuantiti serupa yang dikenali sebagai kesetiaan "
"lapisan (LF) di mana EPLG$_{100}$ = 4/5(1-LF$^{\\frac{1}{99}}$) dan "
"kesetiaan lapisan ialah kesetiaan proses rantai berlapis $N$ qubit. Untuk "
"butiran, lihat kertas [Benchmarking quantum processor performance at "
"scale](https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05933). Perhatikan bahawa dalam kertas "
"tersebut EPLG ditakrifkan untuk ralat proses, tetapi untuk konsistensi "
"dengan ralat get yang dilaporkan secara individu di sini, ia dinyatakan "
"untuk ralat get purata, oleh itu faktor 4/5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On IBM Quantum Platform, the detailed information card for each QPU has a "
"section called Two-qubit gate error (layered), which provides the expanded "
"view of the lowest `two-qubit gate error (layered)` measured as a function "
"of the number of qubits in the chain. The final value, at chain length 100, "
"is the value presented in the Details section. In practice, six 100-qubit "
"chains (pre-selected based on expected optimal performance) are measured, "
"and the value reported for number of qubits `N` is the lowest error found in"
" a subset length `N` chain searching over the six 100-qubit chains.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di IBM Quantum Platform, kad maklumat terperinci untuk setiap QPU mempunyai "
"bahagian yang dipanggil Two-qubit gate error (layered), yang menyediakan "
"paparan diperluas `two-qubit gate error (layered)` terendah yang diukur "
"sebagai fungsi bilangan qubit dalam rantai. Nilai terakhir, pada panjang "
"rantai 100, adalah nilai yang ditunjukkan dalam bahagian Details. Dalam "
"amalan, enam rantai 100-qubit (dipilih terlebih dahulu berdasarkan prestasi "
"optimum yang dijangkakan) diukur, dan nilai yang dilaporkan untuk bilangan "
"qubit `N` adalah ralat terendah yang ditemui dalam rantai subset panjang `N`"
" yang dicari dalam enam rantai 100-qubit.\n"

