#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error in the finite-duration discrete one-qubit gates, measured from "
"randomized benchmarking. The randomized benchmarking sequence includes SX, "
"ID, and X gates, and it is assumed their errors are the same. The ID gate is"
" a delay of duration equal to the duration of the √X and X gates. The RX "
"gate is also the same duration as the √X and X gates with variable "
"amplitude, and so it is reported as having the same error as these gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ralat dalam get satu-qubit diskret berdurasi terhad, diukur daripada penanda"
" aras rawak. Jujukan penanda aras rawak termasuk get SX, ID, dan X, dan "
"ralat mereka dianggap sama. get ID adalah lengah dengan tempoh yang sama "
"dengan tempoh get √X dan X. get RX juga mempunyai tempoh yang sama dengan "
"get √X dan X dengan amplitud berubah, oleh itu dilaporkan sebagai mempunyai "
"ralat yang sama dengan get-gate ini.\n"

