"the qubit in the 0 (1) state and measuring the probability of an output in "
"the 1 (0) state. The reported value is the average of these two errors. The "
"median is taken over all qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kesetiaan operasi bacaan. Ralat bacaan diukur dengan menyediakan qubit dalam"
" keadaan 0 (1) dan mengukur kebarangkalian output dalam keadaan 1 (0). Nilai"
" yang dilaporkan adalah purata dua ralat ini. Median diambil atas semua "
"qubit.\n"

